---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now | Yetyellow" description="Current work on agents, workflow automation and engineering leadership.">
  <section class="page-hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
    <h1>What I am working on now.</h1>
    <p class="lede">These are the areas where I am spending time. I update this page when there is something worth recording.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="now-list" aria-label="Current focus areas">
    <article><span class="mono">01 / PRACTICE</span><h2>Agent design and evaluation</h2><p>I am learning how to turn a broad task into a bounded agent workflow. The focus is on clear inputs, checks on output and knowing when a person needs to decide.</p></article>
    <article><span class="mono">02 / BUILD</span><h2>Workflow automation</h2><p>I am building small automations around routine engineering work. I am looking for work with fewer handovers and less repetition, without losing judgement where it matters.</p></article>
    <article><span class="mono">03 / CONTEXT</span><h2>AI in engineering leadership</h2><p>I am looking at what leaders need to change when teams start using AI: expectations, time to learn, reusable practices and evidence that the effort is worthwhile.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
